{
  "uid": "orders-slo",
  "title": "Orders — SLO & Error Budget",
  "tags": ["orders", "slo"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "The model",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**SLO:** 99% of requests succeed (non-5xx), and 99% complete under 250ms.\n\n**Error budget:** 1% over 30 days ≈ 7h 12m of total failure, or a small amount of failure spread out.\n\n**Burn rate** is how fast you are spending it. Rate 1 exhausts the budget exactly at the end of the window. Rate 14.4 exhausts it in about 2 days — that is a page. Rate 6 takes about 5 days — that is a ticket.\n\nEach burn alert requires a **long AND a short window** to both breach: the long window is stable but slow to fire *and slow to resolve*; the short window is fast both ways but alone fires on every blip. Requiring both gives fast detection and fast reset."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Availability budget remaining (6h)",
      "description": "1 - (observed error ratio / 0.01). Below zero means you have overspent the budget for this window.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "clamp_min(1 - (job:orders_slo_availability_errors:ratio_rate6h / 0.01), 0)",
          "legendFormat": "budget left"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.25 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false } }
    },
    {
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "Latency budget remaining (6h)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "clamp_min(1 - (job:orders_slo_latency_errors:ratio_rate6h / 0.01), 0)",
          "legendFormat": "budget left"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.25 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false } }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability (6h)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - job:orders_slo_availability_errors:ratio_rate6h",
          "legendFormat": "success ratio"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.99 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests under 250ms (6h)",
      "description": "Read straight from the le=\"0.25\" bucket. Phase 2 put a boundary exactly on the SLO threshold so this number is measured, not interpolated — otherwise you would be reporting a guess to customers.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - job:orders_slo_latency_errors:ratio_rate6h",
          "legendFormat": "fast ratio"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 0.99 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Multi-window burn rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Availability burn rate",
      "description": "Both the long and short window must cross a threshold for the corresponding alert to fire. Where the two lines diverge, you are looking at either a blip (short only) or a stale condition (long only).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "job:orders_slo_availability_errors:ratio_rate5m / 0.01", "legendFormat": "5m window" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "job:orders_slo_availability_errors:ratio_rate30m / 0.01", "legendFormat": "30m window" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "job:orders_slo_availability_errors:ratio_rate1h / 0.01", "legendFormat": "1h window" },
        { "refId": "D", "expr": "job:orders_slo_availability_errors:ratio_rate6h / 0.01", "legendFormat": "6h window" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 6 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 14.4 }
            ]
          },
          "custom.thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency burn rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "job:orders_slo_latency_errors:ratio_rate5m / 0.01", "legendFormat": "5m window" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "job:orders_slo_latency_errors:ratio_rate30m / 0.01", "legendFormat": "30m window" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "job:orders_slo_latency_errors:ratio_rate1h / 0.01", "legendFormat": "1h window" },
        { "refId": "D", "expr": "job:orders_slo_latency_errors:ratio_rate6h / 0.01", "legendFormat": "6h window" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 1,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 0, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 6 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 14.4 }
            ]
          },
          "custom.thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Alert state",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Firing alerts",
      "description": "ALERTS is a synthetic series Prometheus generates for every pending or firing alert. Note this is Prometheus's raw view — Alertmanager's inhibition rules mean far fewer notifications are actually delivered.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (alertname, severity) (ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{severity}} — {{alertname}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 30, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" } }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Currently pending or firing",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 23 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "ALERTS", "instant": true, "format": "table" }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "Value": true, "job": true, "__name__": true, "instance": true, "cluster": true, "env": true, "service": true },
            "renameByName": { "alertname": "Alert", "alertstate": "State", "severity": "Severity", "slo": "SLO" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "showHeader": true }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Is alert DELIVERY healthy?",
      "description": "If the notification path is broken, every alert fires into the void and nothing tells you. This is the alert about your alerts.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(alertmanager_notifications_total{integration=\"webhook\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "sent/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(alertmanager_notifications_failed_total{integration=\"webhook\"}[5m])) > 0",
          "legendFormat": "FAILED ({{reason}})"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "auto" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "FAILED.*" }, "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }] }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
